    "   \"id\": \"b88af08b\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Plot 3: How often does the sample argmax differ from deterministic argmax?\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This is a proxy for stochasticity in the *discrete* decision as a function of τ, under Gumbel noise.\\n\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
