    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Visualize the distribution over edge types for a few τ values\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"We show the mean probability vector \\\\(E[y]\\\\) and a histogram of max-probability for a few temperatures.\\n\"\n",
